sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Mobile as Expo Mobile App
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant BookingService as Booking Service
  participant CatalogService as Catalog Service
  participant AvailabilityService as Availability Service
  participant BookingDb as booking
  participant CatalogDb as provider_catalog

  Customer->>Mobile: Confirm booking details
  Mobile->>Gateway: POST /v1/bookings
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate bearer token and role
  Gateway->>BookingService: POST /internal/bookings
  BookingService->>CatalogService: GET provider and service details
  CatalogService->>CatalogDb: Read provider service listing
  CatalogDb-->>CatalogService: Provider service data
  CatalogService-->>BookingService: Provider and service summary
  BookingService->>AvailabilityService: Validate provider schedule
  AvailabilityService->>BookingDb: Check availability windows, days off, and time off
  AvailabilityService->>BookingDb: Check conflicting bookings
  BookingDb-->>AvailabilityService: Availability result
  AvailabilityService-->>BookingService: Available
  BookingService->>BookingDb: Insert booking and timeline event
  BookingDb-->>BookingService: BookingSummary
  BookingService-->>Gateway: BookingSummary
  Gateway-->>Mobile: Created booking
  Mobile-->>Customer: Show pending project
